          "value": "<p>When a creature is hit by Shadow Bolt, reduce all of their speeds by 10ft. This effect is cumulative. If this ability would bring a creatures speed below 0, the creature also has to succeed on a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:26] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p><p>A creature affected by Embrace of Death can remove all penalties to their speed with a single Interact action.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.covalon.varceta-items.Item.s7gWKgXAEZjNcnN7]{Effect: Embrace of Death}</p>"
